    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d655">

                <pb facs="0559" n="443" xml:id="pg443"/>

                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Montreal</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-05-03">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 3, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>La délégation Franchise, a la suite de 1’inauguration du monument Champlain et au
                    moment ou elle quitte le sol des États-Unis, exprime au President de la grande
                    République soeur l’hommage de sa gratitude et de son respect.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hanotaux.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
